# Copy to .env and fill in.
#
# This is the only thing this program reads from the environment: the API key.
# It is looked for under OPENROUTER_API_KEY first and OPEN_ROUTER_KEY second,
# and an explicit argument to Settings(...) wins over both.
#
# Everything else - model, fallback, base URL, rate limits, retries, backoff,
# timeout, batch size, and the ranking thresholds - has a default in
# app/config.py. To change one, pass it in code:
#
#     ResumeRanker.from_settings(Settings.build(jev_model="other/model"))
#
# The defaults are listed in the README's configuration table.

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
